Third-party code

ldm/ and configs/stable-diffusion/v1-inference.yaml are the Stable Diffusion
inference code of CompVis (https://github.com/CompVis/stable-diffusion), used
under its MIT license; the Stable Diffusion v1.4 weights downloaded by
setup/download_sd_ckpt.sh are covered by the CreativeML Open RAIL-M license.
utils/ contains standard OOD-detection evaluation helpers (metrics, SVHN and
LSUN loaders) that originate from the Outlier Exposure code base
(https://github.com/hendrycks/outlier-exposure, Apache 2.0).
